coi rodo

I have composed my version of lojban logo. The main
idea was to generalize logo on 3 dimensional case. I
saved also initial colors and add 3 green tors just to
make logo nicer. Three tors are similar with well
known symbol of atom and thus can be interpreted in
the same way (trajectory of electrons in atom (or even
more generally, as symbol of physic or natural
sciences)). What do you think about this?

